            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Strike and Greater Constrict."
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "The trunk slithers across the battlefield, still animated, and acts in initiative right after the mammoth. It retains Greater Constrict and trunk Strikes but can't use tusk Strikes, foot"
